{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16319070","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16319070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1631907001:1":{"text":"我的第一反应就是雷蒙校长。","source_cn":"我的第一反应就是雷蒙校长。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3DF910E16F030B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631907002:1":{"text":"我也是，变成幽灵还不安分，会去吓唬学生的校长。","source_cn":"我也是，变成幽灵还不安分，会去吓唬学生的校长。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD6234F9573D8CEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631907003:1":{"text":"这么多年来可能只会有他一个。","source_cn":"这么多年来可能只会有他一个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14A0682BECE86D98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631907004:1":{"text":"如果真的是他的话，图书馆幽灵就不用处理了。","source_cn":"如果真的是他的话，图书馆幽灵就不用处理了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x447EE32AA98B5689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631907005:1":{"text":"是啊，那么爱护学生的他又怎么会伤害学生呢。","source_cn":"是啊，那么爱护学生的他又怎么会伤害学生呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA10B3DD704D2EE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1631907006:1":{"text":"只希